a.mp4?t=1761936979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare your cat for the show</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize your cat, changing its color, eyes, or even picking between one of the clothing options available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/0a4b1e962f2168c842f0c1de1aa06947.poster.avif?t=1761936979\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/0a4b1e962f2168c842f0c1de1aa06947.webm?t=1761936979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/0a4b1e962f2168c842f0c1de1aa06947.mp4?t=1761936979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exclusive acts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 20 songs specially made for this spectacle, each with 3 difficulty levels. Either if you don't have any rhythm or if you're the embodiment of a metronome, you can have fun with it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/00dd87d78094368bd86265233f64291b.poster.avif?t=1761936979\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/00dd87d78094368bd86265233f64291b.webm?t=1761936979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/00dd87d78094368bd86265233f64291b.mp4?t=1761936979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >See the big top evolving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you keep the combo sequence going, not only the points multiplier increases but also the environment gets filled with lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/4eec690ccd818814a5a543871f94f417.poster.avif?t=1761936979\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/4eec690ccd818814a5a543871f94f417.webm?t=1761936979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/4eec690ccd818814a5a543871f94f417.mp4?t=1761936979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Sendo Estudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/42b7c0463680d1a9080bc7e8687eb8249dacaf72/header.jpg?t=1761936979","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux distribution released after 2016<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> With OpenGL 3.3 support or higher</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3590590/378663843/ff2a7d08d2e70db3cb6a52d9e88bdad031525c10/1759341513/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759343436","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3590590/378663843/ff2a7d08d2e70db3cb6a52d9e88bdad031525c10/1759341513/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759343436","highl